description =
    A watch and an app designed to help people with dementia and their families live more worry-free lives
content =
     <p>
        Dementia has a profound impact on the lives of those affected and their families. 
        WatchOut helps relatives maintain a clear overview of the situation and 
        enables them to intervene quickly when needed.
    </p> 
    <p>
        WatchOut consists of two parts: a watch and a companion app.
    </p> 
    <p>
        Since people with dementia often retain 
        their familiar habits and memories the longest, the watch has been designed in 
        a classic analogue style. It sends GPS data, features active fall detection, 
        and includes an emergency alert function via two buttons. Despite the added technology, 
        it retains its role as a traditional analogue watch with a crown.
    </p>
    <p>
        The app is simple and minimalistic, designed for quick and easy use. It offers an overview, 
        notifications, and emergency alert functions.
    </p>